\n- **Rollout:** v2.3.2 is now live in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It replaced v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- **Health after the deploy:** The service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV3, checkout-api) records the change, the approval and the post-deploy health. It names v2.3.0 as the version to roll back to if needed, since it was the last healthy one. Opening the incident paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}